OL,3,GNEWSAFestival saved after new location
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of a festival threatened
OL,7,Fwith closure say they "couldn't be more
OL,8,Fexcited" after a licence was granted
OL,9,Ffor it to move to a new site.
OL,11,FThe Godney Gathering, which has
OL,12,Ffeatured artists such as UB40, The
OL,13,FDarkness and Scouting for Girls, has
OL,14,Fbeen held at Garslade Farm, just
OL,15,Foutside Glastonbury, Somerset, since
OL,16,F2014.
OL,18,FThe two-day festival is now set to move
OL,19,Fto nearby Woodford Farm after a licence
OL,20,Fwas approved by Somerset Council.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
